Atomic Git commits

Install:
  Prepare Git when missing; back up and copy the bundled skill files.

Upgrade:
  Replace only this bundled skill using the same installation steps.

Status:
  Report local SKILL.md presence and the Git version.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/git-commit
  An existing Codex copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/git-commit becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ~/.local/state/wsley/skills-backups/.
